      "snippet": {
        "line": 158,
        "text": "def coupling (χ : Space → ℝ) (w u : Space → Space) : ℝ := ∫ x : Space, χ x * ⟪w x, fderiv ℝ u x (w x)⟫_ℝ — with χ ≡ 1 on the support of w this is ∑_{i,j} ∫ w_i w_j ∂_j u_i, the display's first right-hand term"
